    !/**
    !  @Version 1.0
    !  @Author Bruno PERMANNE
    !  @Code rt_plc_bcomp.c
    !  @Group Plc
    !  @Summary Internal Model Controller
    !  Internal Model Controller.
    ! 
    !  For naturaly steady state industrial processes with large natural delay
    !  or even underdamped response, the standard PID is not efficient. Better
    !  behaviour, with accurate and smooth response is for instance achieved by
    !  the numerical internal model controller.
    ! 
    !  The internal model controller is implemented here as a component for ProviewR
    !  by use of Euler
    !  @image orm_compimc1.png
    !  Laplace to z transform translation.
    ! 
    !  The internal model controller need to be set directly with the parameters of a
    !  process model ("Black box transfer function"). The most known is the FOD, ie
    !  First Order Model with Dead time which can be determined experimentally. It's
    !  Laplace tranform is
    !  @image orm_compimc2.png
    !  Whereas FOD is enough for many cases, by applying the principle of parsimony,
    !  IMC for ProviewR can also provide more complexes naturaly steady state models,
    !  as on can see in the following table.
    !  @image orm_compimc3.png
    ! 
    !  @h1 Block diagram
    !  @image orm_compimc4.png
    !  @b Fig 1 CompIMC block diagram
    ! 
    !  @b Object graph
    !  @image orm_compimc_og.png
    ! 
    !  @b Plc coding
    !  For plc coding the function object CompIMC_Fo is used.
    !  @image orm_compimc_fo_fo.png
    !  Create a function object in the plc editor and connect it to the current
    !  object with the connect function.
    ! 
    !  @h2 PLC program sample
    !  @image orm_compimc5.png
    !  @b Fig PLC and Plant IMC with Fifth order with delay (FOULD) simualted process and noise on PV
    ! 
    ! @b See also
    !  @classlink CompIMC_Fo basecomponent_compimc_fo.html
    !  @classlink CompModeIMC basecomponent_compmodeimc.html
    !*/
    Object CompIMC $ClassDef 199 23-MAY-2016 12:45:24.46
      Body SysBody 28-FEB-2023 14:04:49.87
        Attr Editor = 0
        Attr Method = 0
        Attr Flags = 208
