    !/**
    !  @Version 1.0
    !  @Group Valves
    !  @Summary Directional valve with two solenoids.
    !  Base component for a directional valve with two solenoids.
    !  The valve is controlled with two digital order outputs.
    ! 
    !  The buttons for increment and decrement in the object graph can be configure to show
    !  Incr/Decr, Up/Down, Forw/Back or Open/Close.
    ! 
    !  There is no graphical symbol available for this object.
    ! 
    !  @b Object Graph
    !  @image orm_basedirvalve_og.png
    ! 
    !  @b No manual control
    !  @image orm_basedirvalve_example1_og.png
    !  The figure shows a configuration without manual control, i.e. the valve is
    !  always controlled from the ExtOrderIncr and ExtOrderDecr input in the function
    !  object. This is achieved by setting Mode.OpAutoOnly 1.
    ! 
    !  The figure shows a scenario where valve is interlocked via the input ExtInterlock 
    !  in the function object.
    ! 
    !  @Mode
    !  The modes Auto/Man is handled by the mode object, CompModeD2M. See this object for
    !  more information.
    ! 
    !  @h1 Configuration
    !  @b Component Configuration
    !  -IncrDecr      Text of Incr/Decr buttons in object graph is Incr/Decr.
    !  -UpDown        Text of Incr/Decr buttons is On/Off.
    !  -ForwBack      Text of Incr/Decr buttons is Forw/Back.
    !  -OpenClose     Text of Incr/Decr buttons is Open/Close.
    ! 
    !  @b Signals
    !  Signals that should be connected to channel objects:
    ! 
    !  - OrderIncr   Do
    !  - OrderDecr   Do
    ! 
    !  @b Plc coding
    !  For plc coding the function object BaseDirValveFo is used.
    !  @image orm_basedirvalvefo_fo.png
    !  Create a function object in the plc editor and connect it to the current
    !  object with the connect function.
    ! 
    !  @b Simulate
    !  A simulation object is not yet implemented.
    ! 
    !  @b See also
    !  @classlink BaseDirValveFo basecomponent_basedirvalvefo.html
    !*/
    Object BaseDirValve $ClassDef 102 21-SEP-2005 09:25:41.98
      Body SysBody 28-FEB-2023 14:18:52.28
        Attr Editor = 0
        Attr Method = 0
        Attr Flags = 144
        Attr PopEditor = 5
      EndBody
