    !/**
    !  @Version 1.0
    !  @Group Fans
    !  @Author je
    !  @Summary Fan with a Frequencyconverter using Profibus PPO3 protocol
    !  Fan with a Frequencyconverter using Profibus PPO3 protocol
    ! 
    !  @b Graphical Symbol
    !  The graphical symbol for this object is BaseComponent/BaseFcPPO3FanAggr.
    !  @image orm_fanaggr_gs.gif
    !  Default dynamics:
    !  - the fan is filled with the original color when the motor is 
    !    on.
    !  - colored gray when the fan is off.
    !  - colored red when an error occurs.
    !  - colored yellow when a warning occurs.
    !  - indicating the current mode: 
    !    M:  Manual mode.
    !    L: Local mode, mode is set to auto when local is left.
    !    LM: Local mode, mode is set to manual when local is left.
    !    No indication: auto mode.
    ! 
    !  Default action:
    !  - the methods menu is opened with MB3.
    ! 
    !  @b Object Graph
    !  @image orm_basefcppo3fanaggr_og.png
    ! 
    !  @h1 Configuration
    !  Se super class BaseFcPPO3MotorAggr
    !  
    !  @b See also
    !  @classlink BaseFcPPO3MotorAggr basecomponent_basefcppo3motoraggr.html
    !  @classlink BaseFcPPO3MotorAggrFo basecomponent_basefcppo3motoraggrfo.html
    !  @classlink BaseFcPPO3PbModule basecomponent_basefcppo3pbmodule.html
    !  @classlink BaseFcPPO3MotorAggrSim basecomponent_basefcppo3motoraggrsim.html
    !*/
