    !/**
    !  @Version 1.0
    !  @Group Plc
    !  @Summary Get a value in a curve defined by a table with x and y values.
    !  Get a value from a curve by a table with x and y values.
    !  The value is calculated with interpolation. For values outside the curve,
    !  the closest y-value is used.
    ! 
    !  The curve is defined with a CompCurveTab object. This object is specified in
    !  the CurveTabObject attribute.
    ! 
    !  @b Object graph
    !  @image orm_compcurvetabvalue_og.png
